# Vercel CLI writes project/org ids here — not secret, but not repo content either.
.vercel

# Every dotenv variant except the committed template. A blanket `.env*` would swallow
# `.env.example`, which the README tells the reader to copy — CLAUDE.md §7 names only the
# two real ones, and this keeps the file matching that.
.env.*
!.env.example
